Linux IME candidate geometry and OpenURI activation tokens.

Round candidate positions down and cell bottoms up, keeping a nonempty rectangle at
fractional surface scales (Ghostty 83fb956, GTK surface.zig updateImePosition).
Count every text-input object commit and compare Done against that count, refreshing
the first preedit while deferring stale batches; retain the duplicate-coordinate guard.
Inject launcher/portal sinks to verify URI/token forwarding without starting external apps, and remove stale inherited tokens when a request has no token.

